graph TB
    subgraph Repo["trustyai-explainability repo - Maven multi-module"]
        subgraph Service["explainability-service - odh-trustyai-service image (Quarkus 3.20.6.2, Java 17)"]
            Consumer["ConsumerEndpoint<br/>POST /consumer/kserve/v2"]
            CE["CloudEventConsumer<br/>Funqy Knative Events<br/>100 MB gzip cap"]
            Reconcilers["ModelMesh / KServe<br/>Payload Reconcilers"]
            Storage["Storage Backends<br/>MEMORY / PVC CSV / MINIO / DATABASE"]
            MetricsAPI["Metrics REST API<br/>/metrics/group/fairness, /metrics/drift,<br/>/metrics/identity"]
            DataAPI["Data & Info API<br/>/data/upload, /info/*"]
            Scheduler["PrometheusScheduler<br/>every service.metrics-schedule"]
            Publisher["PrometheusPublisher<br/>trustyai_* Micrometer gauges<br/>GET /q/metrics"]
            Explainers["Explainer Endpoints<br/>/explainers/local/*, /explainers/global/*<br/>disabled in %rhoai profile"]
        end
        Core["explainability-core<br/>LIME, SHAP, CF/OptaPlanner, PDP, TSSaliency<br/>SPD, DIR, Meanshift, KS-test, Fourier MMD"]
        Connectors["explainability-connectors<br/>KServe v1/v2 HTTP + v2 gRPC clients"]
        Arrow["explainability-arrow<br/>Arrow Java/Python interop"]
        IT["explainability-integrationtests<br/>not shipped"]
    end

    Consumer --> Reconcilers
    CE --> Reconcilers
    DataAPI --> Storage
    Reconcilers --> Storage
    MetricsAPI -->|registers requests| Scheduler
    Scheduler -->|reads dataframes| Storage
    Scheduler -->|computes via| Core
    Scheduler --> Publisher
    Explainers --> Core
    Explainers --> Connectors

    Operator["trustyai-service-operator<br/>TrustyAIService CR"] -.->|deploys + kube-rbac-proxy sidecars<br/>RHOAI 3.7: deploys Python image instead| Service
    ModelMesh["ModelMesh payload processor"] -->|POST partial payloads| Consumer
    KServeLogger["KServe InferenceService logger"] -->|CloudEvents request/response| CE
    User["User / RHOAI Dashboard"] -->|via kube-rbac-proxy 8443| MetricsAPI
    Prometheus["Prometheus / UWM"] -->|scrape| Publisher
    Connectors -->|"gRPC ModelInfer (plaintext)"| ModelServer["Model Server<br/>same-namespace Service"]
    Storage -->|PVC| PVC["PVC 1Gi RWO<br/>/inputs/data.csv"]
    Storage -->|JDBC| DB["MariaDB / MySQL"]
    Storage -->|S3 API| MinIO["MinIO"]
    PyService["trustyai-service Python<br/>odh-trustyai-service-py"] -.->|successor in 3.7 bundle| Service

